# Written at RUNTIME, never by the package: these are the wallpapers the
# admin uploaded on the Mint Wallpaper settings page. sysupgrade only
# preserves conffiles, /etc/sysupgrade.conf and the paths listed in a
# package's /lib/upgrade/keep.d/*, so without this file every firmware
# upgrade silently discards them.
#
# /etc/config/mint is a conffile of this package, so it is preserved
# without being listed here.
#
# The wallpaper-*.img cache files are deliberately NOT listed - the
# mz-wallpaper-fetch cron regenerates them within one period.
